# Whitelist context: no sources ever reach the daemon. The builder image works
# on mounted sources at runtime; the deploy image copies only the collected
# docker-artifacts/{bin,python-lib} plus the runtime data (dist/). The
# builder's build/ and node-base/ live inside docker-artifacts/ too, so they
# are re-excluded below.
*
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.build
!docker-compose.yml
!docker/
!dist/
!docker-artifacts/
docker-artifacts/build/
docker-artifacts/node-base/
docker-artifacts/artifacts/
!README.md
